{
    "title": "Baby Daybook - Newborn Tracker",
    "description": "<b>All-in-one Newborn Tracker app</b>\r\n\r\nIf you're in search of a parenting app that makes it easy to track your newborn's routine, you've found it! \r\nBaby Daybook is a free baby tracker app with everything a new parent needs, including a breastfeeding and diaper tracker, bottle feeding and sleep tracking, growth milestones, and health.\r\nWith our easy-to-use activity log and customizable tracking options, you can monitor every aspect of your baby's care. Baby Daybook is here to share the care and make parenting easier.\r\n\r\n<b>ESSENTIAL NEWBORN CARE TRACKING</b>\r\n\r\nAs a baby schedule tracker, Baby Daybook does it all - it is a baby feeding and diaper tracker, a baby sleep tracker, and a growth tracker with comprehensive charts and analysis.\r\n\r\n<b>Baby Feeding Tracker</b>\r\nWhether it's breastfeeding, pumping, bottle-feeding, or introducing solid food, our intuitive logs offer comprehensive information.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Breastfeeding Tracker. Start and stop breastfeeding timer to track the feeding duration for each breast. \r\n\u2022 Pumping tracker. Log breast pumping sessions and monitor breast milk output.\r\n\u2022 Baby Bottle Feeding Log. Track your baby\u2019s bottles of breastmilk or formula.\r\n\u2022 Baby Food Tracker. Record your baby's first foods, their reactions, and preferences as they transition to baby solid foods.\r\n\r\n<b>Baby Sleep Tracker</b>\r\nWith our advanced monitoring and analysis tools, you can keep track of your baby's sleep patterns and create personalized sleep schedules to ensure sweet dreams for your child and peace of mind for yourself.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Track your baby's sleep duration, including day naps, night sleep, and awake times, and track changes over time.\r\n\u2022 Recognize your baby\u2019s day nap and nighttime sleep patterns.\r\n\r\n<b>Diaper Tracker and Potty Training</b>\r\nKeep track of your baby's diaper changes and keep tabs on potty training progress. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Diaper Tracker. Log each diaper change, including contents, time, and how many diapers you changed in a day.\r\n\u2022 Potty Training. Track your baby's potty times, recognize common times, and set helpful reminders for successful potty training.\r\n\r\n<b>Health Tracker and Growth Monitoring</b>\r\nHealth and growth tracking features provide detailed information to help you monitor baby's health, development, and milestones.\r\n\u2022 Baby Health Tracker. Record temperature, symptoms, medications, vaccinations, and doctor visits.\r\n\u2022 Growth Tracker allows you to enter your baby's measurement data, view growth charts, and compare it to CDC and WHO standards for comprehensive health monitoring.\r\n\u2022 Teething Tracker includes a Baby Teeth Chart and helps you to keep track of your baby's teeth development.\r\n\r\nAnd More: Log bath time, tummy time, outdoor walks, playtime, and other activities. Use custom activities to record anything you want.\r\n\r\n<b>Advanced Features</b>\r\n\u2022 Real-Time Family Sync. Instantly share logs and updates with caregivers to keep everyone up-to-date.\r\n\u2022 Insightful Statistics. Access daily summaries and detailed analytics to understand feeding habits, sleep schedules, and health patterns.\r\n\u2022 Customizable Reminders. Set reminders for feeding, diaper change, sleep, or health check to maintain a consistent routine for your baby.\r\n\u2022 Photo Moments & Milestones. Our photo album feature allows you to capture and cherish every significant milestone, creating lasting memories.\r\n\u2022 Growth and Development Tracking. Track every aspect of your baby\u2019s development, from baby teeth chart to growth milestones.\r\n\r\n<b>Tailored for Easy Parenting</b>\r\n\u2022 Interactive Timeline. Visualize your baby's day and quickly locate specific activities.\r\n\u2022 Exportable Data. Easily share your baby\u2019s growth and health data with doctors through printable files.\r\n\u2022 With widgets and Wear OS support (including tiles and complications), vital information is just a glance away, even on the go.\r\n\r\nGet Baby Daybook, the best free baby tracker app, to have all of your baby's information right at your fingertips. Try it now and see why it's the only baby app a new parent needs!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>All-in-one Newborn Tracker app</b><br><br>If you&#39;re in search of a parenting app that makes it easy to track your newborn&#39;s routine, you&#39;ve found it! <br>Baby Daybook is a free baby tracker app with everything a new parent needs, including a breastfeeding and diaper tracker, bottle feeding and sleep tracking, growth milestones, and health.<br>With our easy-to-use activity log and customizable tracking options, you can monitor every aspect of your baby&#39;s care. Baby Daybook is here to share the care and make parenting easier.<br><br><b>ESSENTIAL NEWBORN CARE TRACKING</b><br><br>As a baby schedule tracker, Baby Daybook does it all - it is a baby feeding and diaper tracker, a baby sleep tracker, and a growth tracker with comprehensive charts and analysis.<br><br><b>Baby Feeding Tracker</b><br>Whether it&#39;s breastfeeding, pumping, bottle-feeding, or introducing solid food, our intuitive logs offer comprehensive information.<br><br>\u2022 Breastfeeding Tracker. Start and stop breastfeeding timer to track the feeding duration for each breast. <br>\u2022 Pumping tracker. Log breast pumping sessions and monitor breast milk output.<br>\u2022 Baby Bottle Feeding Log. Track your baby\u2019s bottles of breastmilk or formula.<br>\u2022 Baby Food Tracker. Record your baby&#39;s first foods, their reactions, and preferences as they transition to baby solid foods.<br><br><b>Baby Sleep Tracker</b><br>With our advanced monitoring and analysis tools, you can keep track of your baby&#39;s sleep patterns and create personalized sleep schedules to ensure sweet dreams for your child and peace of mind for yourself.<br><br>\u2022 Track your baby&#39;s sleep duration, including day naps, night sleep, and awake times, and track changes over time.<br>\u2022 Recognize your baby\u2019s day nap and nighttime sleep patterns.<br><br><b>Diaper Tracker and Potty Training</b><br>Keep track of your baby&#39;s diaper changes and keep tabs on potty training progress. <br><br>\u2022 Diaper Tracker. Log each diaper change, including contents, time, and how many diapers you changed in a day.<br>\u2022 Potty Training. Track your baby&#39;s potty times, recognize common times, and set helpful reminders for successful potty training.<br><br><b>Health Tracker and Growth Monitoring</b><br>Health and growth tracking features provide detailed information to help you monitor baby&#39;s health, development, and milestones.<br>\u2022 Baby Health Tracker. Record temperature, symptoms, medications, vaccinations, and doctor visits.<br>\u2022 Growth Tracker allows you to enter your baby&#39;s measurement data, view growth charts, and compare it to CDC and WHO standards for comprehensive health monitoring.<br>\u2022 Teething Tracker includes a Baby Teeth Chart and helps you to keep track of your baby&#39;s teeth development.<br><br>And More: Log bath time, tummy time, outdoor walks, playtime, and other activities. Use custom activities to record anything you want.<br><br><b>Advanced Features</b><br>\u2022 Real-Time Family Sync. Instantly share logs and updates with caregivers to keep everyone up-to-date.<br>\u2022 Insightful Statistics. Access daily summaries and detailed analytics to understand feeding habits, sleep schedules, and health patterns.<br>\u2022 Customizable Reminders. Set reminders for feeding, diaper change, sleep, or health check to maintain a consistent routine for your baby.<br>\u2022 Photo Moments &amp; Milestones. Our photo album feature allows you to capture and cherish every significant milestone, creating lasting memories.<br>\u2022 Growth and Development Tracking. Track every aspect of your baby\u2019s development, from baby teeth chart to growth milestones.<br><br><b>Tailored for Easy Parenting</b><br>\u2022 Interactive Timeline. Visualize your baby&#39;s day and quickly locate specific activities.<br>\u2022 Exportable Data. Easily share your baby\u2019s growth and health data with doctors through printable files.<br>\u2022 With widgets and Wear OS support (including tiles and complications), vital information is just a glance away, even on the go.<br><br>Get Baby Daybook, the best free baby tracker app, to have all of your baby&#39;s information right at your fingertips. Try it now and see why it&#39;s the only baby app a new parent needs!",
